_id":"video:cmu3h99h6001tbn5kpr8n6err","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"港鐵已經將乘車資訊同服務全面電子化喇！從應用人工智能虛擬服務大使Tracy，到站內嘅各種電子資訊，喺科技嘅加持下，大家嘅出行體驗就更個人化、更自主、更環保！ 想幾時搭、點樣搭，都更容易掌握！ 就等陳湛文為我哋介紹吓港鐵嘅電子化資訊同服務啦～去片！ #全面電子化資訊服務 #智慧科技 #智慧出行 #虛擬服務大使 #人工智能 #下班車到站資訊 #電子資訊屏 #MTRMobile #出行碼 #替代路綫 #陳湛文 #PeterChan MTR has fully digitalised the train information and services! From our AI Virtual Service Ambassador “Tracy” to various digitalised train information and services, we have applied innovative technologies to make your journeys more personalised, hassle-free and eco-friendly, so it is easier for you to plan your journeys! Let's take a tour with Peter to learn more about our digital information and services! #DigitalInnovation #InnovativeTechnology #SmartMobility #VirtualServiceAmbassador #AI #NextTrainArrivalTimeInformation #DigitalPanels #MTRMobile #TravelQRCode #AlternativeRoutes #PeterChan","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3h99h6001tbn5kpr8n6err:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3h99h6001tbn5kpr8n6err","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3h99h6001tbn5kpr8n6err:0006","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3h99h6001tbn5kpr8n6err","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"media_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"createdA